# === Ingress/Forward rules (Neanelu) -- ADITIVE pe hz.247 ===
# Scop:
# - Traefik (orchestrator 10.0.0.2) -> CT111/CT112 ports (app)
# - Prometheus (orchestrator 10.0.0.2) -> CT111/CT112 scrape ports
# - CT111/CT112 -> orchestrator Redis/OpenBao (daca FORWARD default policy nu e ACCEPT)
#
# Aplicare (manual, pe hz.247):
# - adauga liniile in `/etc/iptables.rules` (dupa regulile existente ale altor proiecte)
# - apoi: `iptables-restore < /etc/iptables.rules`
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - acestea sunt reguli de FORWARD (nu INPUT). Nu expun nimic public; doar permit traficul intre VLAN-uri.

*filter
# Traefik orchestrator -> app (prod/staging)
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.0.2/32 -d 10.0.1.111/32 -p tcp -m multiport --dports 65000,65001 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.0.2/32 -d 10.0.1.112/32 -p tcp -m multiport --dports 65000,65001 -j ACCEPT

# Prometheus orchestrator -> node-exporter + cAdvisor (prod/staging)
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.0.2/32 -d 10.0.1.111/32 -p tcp -m multiport --dports 65210,65211 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.0.2/32 -d 10.0.1.112/32 -p tcp -m multiport --dports 65210,65211 -j ACCEPT

# CT111/CT112 -> orchestrator Redis/OpenBao (daca FORWARD policy e restrictiva)
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.111/32 -d 10.0.0.2/32 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 6379 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.111/32 -d 10.0.0.2/32 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 8200 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.112/32 -d 10.0.0.2/32 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 6379 -j ACCEPT
-A FORWARD -s 10.0.1.112/32 -d 10.0.0.2/32 -p tcp -m tcp --dport 8200 -j ACCEPT
COMMIT

